id: pm-starter-sdk-floor-1025
title: Align host and npm floors with published SDK capabilities
description: "Audit runtime SDK usage on main against published artifacts, record first-version evidence, and enforce the required compatibility floor without changing the development SDK pin."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: audit-1025,"gh:unbraind/pm-starter#157",sdk-floor
created_at: "2026-10-26T06:02:36.792Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T06:25:43.565Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Source API inventory and published adjacent-release evidence recorded; both supported-host declarations cover every used API; targeted checks pass; review evidence remains separate from release authority.
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T06:02:54.889Z",codex-agent,"Auditing the current main runtime imports, client calls, and host context members. First-release evidence will come from published npm tarballs packed with lifecycle scripts disabled, inspected as data only. Existing tracker histories remain append-only."
  "2026-10-26T06:17:21.916Z",codex-agent,"Regression evidence: restoring only the original manifest/peer/lock declarations (2026.8.15) makes node --test test/sdk-floor.test.ts fail specifically because PmClient.listAllComplete first ships in 2026.8.18 (one source-inventory test passes, one floor test fails). Restoring 2026.8.18 passes both. Adding an otherwise unlisted nowIso SDK import to runtime source also fails the source-inventory test; restoring source passes. Local build, test compilation, and the targeted SDK/floor/command suite pass 93/93 with no skips. CI npm and Bun release gates will provide full-gate evidence."
  "2026-10-26T06:17:27.353Z",codex-agent,"Floor change required: 42 source-derived API contracts require pm 2026.8.18; main declares host 2026.8.15 and npm >=2026.8.15. Audited main af1722d8414ddeb016fc8a4e8a91732c1ca04f9f. Binary search inspected 98 published stable tarballs, their static ESM exports and dist declarations, with adjacent negative/positive boundaries and SHA-256 receipts. Full API-to-first-version table and per-source uses are committed in docs/sdk-floor.md and docs/sdk-floor.json. No downloaded pm code was executed; this is API-availability evidence, not older-host behavioral acceptance. Raise manifest and peer/lock root metadata from 2026.8.15 to 2026.8.18; retain the 2026.10.20 development pin. The new test compares real source symbols with the committed capability table, then checks both declarations against every first version. Fixes GitHub issue #157."
  "2026-10-26T06:19:52.359Z",codex-agent,"Final targeted suite passed 94/94, with zero skipped or canceled tests, including the real host compatibility checker accepting target 2026.8.18 and refusing target 2026.8.17 with pm_min_version_unmet. This checker is the current pinned host implementation, not an execution of either historical artifact. Final floor-only revert proof: one inventory test passes and two tests fail (declared API floor and actual manifest refusal). npm run build, npm run build:test, npm run typecheck, npm run docstring and tracker-linked targeted execution passed. The unlisted-import negative proof also passed. CI release gates remain the full-suite evidence."
  "2026-10-26T06:25:42.482Z",codex-agent,"Packaging review added docs/sdk-floor.md and docs/sdk-floor.json to the explicit npm files list so the README and inventory links also resolve in the packed package. Normalized compiler source paths for portability. Test compilation, npm pack dry-run and the tracker-linked suite pass again (94 tests). Local strict health is blocked by extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew between the pinned 2026.10.20 host and a locally registered pm-github built with 2026.10.25; no extension/global environment state was changed. Clean CI health and full npm/Bun release gates remain pending on PR #162."
